WEBVTT

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.264
Move, move!

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:16.976
Don't move!

00:00:18.394 --> 00:00:19.270
Quit it, Rene

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.565
When Gisey gets back, I'm gonna tell on you!

00:00:22.815 --> 00:00:24.859
Gonna tell on you!

00:00:28.863 --> 00:00:30.615
It's just not the same without them...

00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:34.410
I hope Fam and Gisey'll be back soon.

00:00:35.828 --> 00:00:37.872
Are they gonna come back?

00:00:38.122 --> 00:00:39.040
Yeah.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.125
They will. For sure.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:46.130
Fam and Gisey have the wind
on their side, after all!

00:00:56.557 --> 00:00:59.018
The Fuchs and Fr6hlich are plummeting!

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:06.692
--How many ships do we have left?!
--Twenty-five remain!

00:01:06.943 --> 00:01:07.985
All ships, forward!

00:01:08.236 --> 00:01:11.072
The Grand Exile must not be taken down!

00:01:12.907 --> 00:01:14.408
The Silvius has run aground!

00:01:14.659 --> 00:01:17.161
--And the Vanship squadron?!
--All ships have departed!

00:01:17.411 --> 00:01:19.622
We've no spare ships to help the Silvius!

00:01:19.872 --> 00:01:21.582
Our fleet will focus entirely

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:24.835
on neutralizing the Grand Exile's
main guns from the inside!

00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:26.879
All ships, forward!

00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:34.720
Any report from the infiltration team?!

00:01:34.971 --> 00:01:38.307
There's been no contact since they
encountered enemy starfish ships!

00:01:39.976 --> 00:01:42.186
Fam... Giselle...

00:01:49.235 --> 00:01:52.196
So it's you. I'm impressed.

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:57.243
What have you done to Sari?!

00:01:57.493 --> 00:02:01.497
She's simply resting. She was a bit exhausted.

00:02:01.747 --> 00:02:03.874
She's in no danger whatsoever.

00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:05.918
How dare you...?!

00:02:06.168 --> 00:02:07.628
Fan'!

00:02:09.797 --> 00:02:14.802
Once she awakes, this will be a changed world.

00:02:15.052 --> 00:02:19.098
This isn't what Sire“! wished for!

00:02:20.766 --> 00:02:23.769
She'd never use a ship like
this to destroy everything

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:26.272
and cause everyone suffering!

00:02:29.984 --> 00:02:32.445
Damn birdbrains!

00:02:33.821 --> 00:02:35.781
--Heine?!
--It's okay! I'm fine!

00:02:36.032 --> 00:02:39.160
Engine and fuel lines are all green! Go!

00:02:41.912 --> 00:02:44.623
Never underestimate the Sky Pirate spirit!

00:02:54.884 --> 00:02:57.511
--There's no end to them...
--Don't break formation.

00:02:57.762 --> 00:02:59.889
Let's secure an escape route for Fam!

00:03:06.312 --> 00:03:08.647
Fam! Where are you?!

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:20.326
Don't worry.

00:03:21.619 --> 00:03:23.788
<i>I will protect</i> you.

00:03:25.331 --> 00:03:27.291
Please, no more...

00:03:28.459 --> 00:03:31.670
No more people dying!

00:03:31.921 --> 00:03:35.925
This ship wasn't actually
created to cause destruction.

00:03:36.175 --> 00:03:40.721
It, too, was once meant for the skies.

00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:43.391
The skies...?

00:03:43.641 --> 00:03:45.810
In the era of the great cataclysm,

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.270
your ancestors- the ancestors
of the repatriates--

00:03:48.521 --> 00:03:52.733
constructed the Exiles and fled from this world.

00:03:54.777 --> 00:04:01.492
The people they abandoned on this
crumbling world dreamed of one thing...

00:04:03.994 --> 00:04:08.749
Wings to break free of this broken
world and soar beyond the sky.

00:04:08.999 --> 00:04:12.002
An Exile surpassing all other Exiles.

00:04:12.253 --> 00:04:20.344
We continued to hold fast to that dream...
generation after generation.

00:04:25.641 --> 00:04:29.353
Are you sure that dream has come to pass?

00:04:33.149 --> 00:04:36.569
This ship is incomplete.

00:04:36.819 --> 00:04:39.822
She was abandoned long ago.

00:04:41.365 --> 00:04:44.785
She was left unfinished and forgotten...

00:04:45.035 --> 00:04:46.495
Indeed.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:51.625
That is why I will fulfill that dream.

00:04:51.876 --> 00:04:53.878
I have but one goal...

00:04:54.128 --> 00:04:59.758
To unify the world under
Maestro Sire“! and lead it to peace.

00:05:00.009 --> 00:05:02.970
By any means necessary!

00:05:15.149 --> 00:05:19.195
More loading acoustics from inside
the Grand Exile! Over ten tons again!

00:05:19.445 --> 00:05:22.781
Target orientation, 191 degrees...
The target remains unchanged!

00:05:23.032 --> 00:05:26.660
Hmm. Guess he's intent on taking out Turan.

00:05:26.911 --> 00:05:28.370
What a pickle.

00:05:28.621 --> 00:05:31.290
Especially with the Silvius immobilized...

00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:34.460
All hands, brace for impact!

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:38.214
Back us away while firing the bow cannons!

00:05:38.464 --> 00:05:39.965
Fire!

00:05:44.303 --> 00:05:45.971
Forward guns are operational!

00:05:46.222 --> 00:05:47.515
Secondary lateral guns are ready!

00:05:47.765 --> 00:05:48.849
You heard 'em!

00:05:49.099 --> 00:05:51.560
Flank speed! Rendezvous with the fleet!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.980
Let's take out the Grand Exile's guns!

00:05:59.944 --> 00:06:05.157
With the Grand Exile, Premier Luscinia
will bring peace unto this world.

00:06:05.407 --> 00:06:07.701
And <i>we</i> shall pave the way!

00:06:07.952 --> 00:06:10.079
Gloria, Augusta!

00:06:10.329 --> 00:06:15.543
Indeed, the premier's method
might have the quickest results.

00:06:15.793 --> 00:06:20.256
I guess it goes to show how
wet behind the ears I still am...

00:06:21.423 --> 00:06:24.510
Engine output dropping!
We've lost Artillery Battery B!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:28.389
3rd and 4th Squadrons have fallen away!
Unable to maintain formation!

00:06:28.639 --> 00:06:30.724
What point is there to a life

00:06:30.975 --> 00:06:34.395
devoid of freedom and free will--
a life in which you simply "persist"?!

00:06:34.645 --> 00:06:37.106
This is for Augusta Sara's dreams and ideals!

00:06:37.356 --> 00:06:39.817
Don't give up! All ships, charge!

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:44.071
Gloria, Augusta! Gloria, Augusta!

00:06:44.321 --> 00:06:47.324
Your hopes for a Grand Race are indeed noble.

00:06:47.575 --> 00:06:51.829
However, as you are most certainly aware,

00:06:52.079 --> 00:06:55.749
that goal was beyond even
Augusta Farahnéz herself.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.003
Ideals alone cannot change the world.

00:06:59.253 --> 00:07:01.005
I know.

00:07:01.255 --> 00:07:08.512
I know this is the real world
and things aren't that simple.

00:07:08.762 --> 00:07:14.393
I know chasing after dreams with
blind faith will amount to nothing.

00:07:14.643 --> 00:07:17.354
I know that now!

00:07:22.818 --> 00:07:24.278
But...

00:07:25.738 --> 00:07:28.824
...I want to dream!

00:07:30.284 --> 00:07:34.788
After all, it's the Grand Race that guided me.

00:07:35.039 --> 00:07:39.960
That single wish has kept me aloft
and brought me this far.

00:07:41.462 --> 00:07:43.213
It's the precious dream I was given

00:07:43.464 --> 00:07:48.177
by the people who made a
Grand Race a reality that day...

00:07:54.516 --> 00:07:57.686
So... I'm going to keep on flying!

00:08:12.868 --> 00:08:15.496
Fire time-delay torpedoes!

00:08:18.207 --> 00:08:22.628
Use the ship as a shield to
make way for our empress!

00:08:22.878 --> 00:08:26.090
Concentrate all fire on the
operational enemy cannon!

00:08:29.677 --> 00:08:33.097
Just as I thought...
They aren't offensive weapons.

00:08:33.347 --> 00:08:34.973
They're for something else...

00:08:35.224 --> 00:08:39.353
What now? We could
retreat for the time being...

00:08:39.603 --> 00:08:43.273
Fam <i>will</i> bring Sire“! back out. I know it.

00:08:46.276 --> 00:08:49.196
Target all guns on the
Grand Exile's interior walls!

00:08:49.446 --> 00:08:51.657
Draw the tentacles' attention to us!

00:08:51.907 --> 00:08:53.367
Fire!

00:09:04.253 --> 00:09:10.217
Maybe you're right, and our
dream will fall apart again.

00:09:12.803 --> 00:09:18.892
Maybe everyone's hate
and sadness won't go away.

00:09:23.647 --> 00:09:26.191
Even so, I'll keep on flying!

00:09:29.486 --> 00:09:34.408
Because I know someone
will keep our dream going!

00:10:01.685 --> 00:10:04.146
I'm glad you came.

00:10:06.732 --> 00:10:10.402
I can't take her with me.

00:10:17.201 --> 00:10:18.911
It's time.

00:10:36.261 --> 00:10:38.263
Shattering acoustics from enemy hull!

00:10:38.514 --> 00:10:40.432
In the vicinity of the gun about to fire!

00:10:40.682 --> 00:10:41.600
What's happening?!

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.770
It's spreading through the entire
ship at tremendous speed!

00:10:53.111 --> 00:10:55.781
They aren't guns after all...

00:10:56.031 --> 00:10:58.617
They're enormous propulsion engines?!

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.371
Ah, so that's what you were up to.

00:11:04.498 --> 00:11:06.875
You wanted to take everyone into the sky,

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:11.171
so you prepared your many wings.

00:11:11.421 --> 00:11:14.341
But it was never to be.

00:11:15.843 --> 00:11:19.930
What the heck's up with
this oversized birdbrain?!

00:11:21.098 --> 00:11:24.601
Unable to continue fighting! Follow me!

00:11:43.954 --> 00:11:47.791
Grand Exile structural collapse at 20... 28%!

00:11:48.041 --> 00:11:49.126
Self-destruction accelerating!

00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:52.170
All ships are requesting orders, Sir!

00:11:55.382 --> 00:11:57.593
All hands, abandon ship.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.846
Our era is over.

00:12:01.096 --> 00:12:05.350
All crew members are to disarm and
obey the Joint Forces' instructions.

00:12:05.601 --> 00:12:06.810
B-But, Sir...!

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:11.940
The premier himself issued this order in advance.

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:18.071
Guzel. Might I ask one favor of you?

00:12:18.322 --> 00:12:19.823
Of course, Sir.

00:12:23.702 --> 00:12:26.914
Make sure my granddaughter gets this...

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:46.475
You knew this would happen
from the very start?!

00:12:51.939 --> 00:12:53.607
Yet, you still...?!

00:12:55.943 --> 00:12:58.278
Luscinia! Come with us!

00:12:59.696 --> 00:13:00.447
Sari doesn't...

00:13:00.697 --> 00:13:03.992
Sire“! doesn't want anyone else to die!

00:13:11.124 --> 00:13:19.341
Liliana said she didn't resent her
fate of being born as an Exile key.

00:13:19.591 --> 00:13:22.344
Alauda and I feel the same.

00:13:22.594 --> 00:13:24.304
Take care of Maestro Séré.

00:13:24.554 --> 00:13:26.223
--Luscinia!
--Fam!

00:13:26.473 --> 00:13:30.018
After all the death and sadness you've caused...!

00:13:30.268 --> 00:13:34.940
You can at least take responsibility
like a grown man, Luscinia!

00:13:36.858 --> 00:13:38.944
Come back, Fam!

00:13:45.575 --> 00:13:49.162
Falling debris has increased
the load on our keel by 70%!

00:13:49.413 --> 00:13:51.832
--The ship can't withstand this!
"Where's the infiltration team?!

00:13:52.082 --> 00:13:54.918
The ships report they're on their way out now!

00:13:55.168 --> 00:13:56.128
And Sire-l?!

00:13:56.378 --> 00:13:59.464
Still no word that the Augusta has been secured.

00:14:01.383 --> 00:14:02.843
Fam...

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:08.140
The Grand Exile is descending!

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:11.351
150 seconds of operational altitude!

00:14:15.313 --> 00:14:17.482
--The Senapati!
--What?!

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:21.737
Follow me, firang!

00:14:21.987 --> 00:14:23.655
Sorfish...

00:14:23.905 --> 00:14:27.117
All ships, follow the Senapati!
We're making a run for it!

00:14:42.007 --> 00:14:45.594
We can't wait for the Augusta's
rescue team any longer.

00:14:45.844 --> 00:14:46.928
Engines to maximum!

00:14:47.179 --> 00:14:49.347
Take us away from the Grand Exile!

00:14:49.598 --> 00:14:51.224
Millia...

00:14:51.475 --> 00:14:53.852
Engines to maximum! Take us up!

00:15:04.321 --> 00:15:06.573
10 seconds straight, then turn right!

00:15:06.823 --> 00:15:08.325
R°gefl

00:15:38.396 --> 00:15:40.482
Lili... ana...

00:15:41.608 --> 00:15:48.698
Will this world truly change...?

00:16:30.782 --> 00:16:32.450
Fam...

00:16:39.332 --> 00:16:40.792
This engine acoustic...

00:16:41.042 --> 00:16:42.502
It's Pam's ship!

00:16:49.384 --> 00:16:50.844
Light signal from the Vespa!

00:16:51.094 --> 00:16:53.847
"Augusta has been rescued!"

00:16:56.016 --> 00:16:58.268
Fam... Giselle...

00:16:58.518 --> 00:17:00.520
They did great, didn't they?

00:17:02.314 --> 00:17:04.441
The Augusta is safe!

00:17:04.691 --> 00:17:07.360
--Augusta Sire-l!
--Long live the Augusta!

00:17:08.403 --> 00:17:11.072
Augusta... Thank goodness...

00:17:11.323 --> 00:17:13.742
--You actually did it!
--Birdbrain!

00:17:13.992 --> 00:17:16.828
Fam! Gisey!

00:17:17.954 --> 00:17:20.916
Her 16th Skyfish turned out to be a big one...

00:17:21.166 --> 00:17:22.626
Yes.

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.171
Fam! Giselle!

00:17:26.421 --> 00:17:29.382
Sara! sara!

00:17:31.343 --> 00:17:33.178
Séré!

00:17:33.428 --> 00:17:36.598
Giselle?

00:17:36.848 --> 00:17:37.933
<i>F am?</i>

00:17:38.183 --> 00:17:39.809
Séré!

00:17:41.686 --> 00:17:43.897
Where's Vasant? And Luscinia?!

00:17:44.147 --> 00:17:46.024
Where are they?!

00:17:46.274 --> 00:17:47.234
Fan'!

00:17:47.484 --> 00:17:50.028
Where are they?! Tell me, Fam!

00:18:19.349 --> 00:18:21.142
You're sure this is all of them?

00:18:21.393 --> 00:18:23.561
You aren't hiding any other ships, I hope!

00:18:23.812 --> 00:18:25.689
You don't trust us?!

00:18:25.939 --> 00:18:28.149
Ades completely agrees with disarmament!

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:32.195
Man! They use some great
Claudia Units, that's for sure!

00:18:32.445 --> 00:18:33.863
Bet we can get a lot for 'em!

00:18:34.114 --> 00:18:36.116
C'mon! Quit slacking, you old fogies!

00:18:36.366 --> 00:18:38.827
--Get to work!
--So busy! So busy!

00:18:39.077 --> 00:18:41.454
I wonder what we can build with these Units...

00:18:41.705 --> 00:18:45.375
I hear Turan's started using 'em
for power generators!

00:18:47.252 --> 00:18:49.087
With this sacred water

00:18:49.337 --> 00:18:55.135
from the blue depths of The Hole,
the source of the Grand Lake...

00:19:02.434 --> 00:19:04.352
Allow me to take that.

00:19:04.602 --> 00:19:09.649
All member nations now agree to
harmoniously coexist as neighbors,

00:19:09.899 --> 00:19:13.945
as well as strive to uphold peace and security.

00:19:15.405 --> 00:19:19.242
At long last, the world can now move forward.

00:19:19.492 --> 00:19:22.162
Yes. Let us work hard together!

00:19:22.412 --> 00:19:26.458
Many Ades citizens still seem anxious, though.

00:19:26.708 --> 00:19:29.753
Firang. Go help them out, okay?

00:19:30.003 --> 00:19:32.505
Gloria, Augusta.

00:19:32.756 --> 00:19:37.802
Having you serve as the mediator
is very reassuring, Premier Orang!

00:19:38.053 --> 00:19:41.848
Sorfish is my senior; he should
be the one filling this role.

00:19:42.098 --> 00:19:43.641
But he...

00:19:48.605 --> 00:19:53.026
Maybe I should learn how to fly a Vespa too...

00:19:53.276 --> 00:19:56.780
I bet you'd be all for that too, huh, Vasant?

00:19:59.657 --> 00:20:01.493
He wanted you to have this.

00:20:01.743 --> 00:20:03.203
Me...?

00:20:06.206 --> 00:20:08.041
She looks just like you, Fam!

00:20:08.291 --> 00:20:09.250
Is this...?!

00:20:09.501 --> 00:20:13.088
Admiral Sadri wanted his
granddaughter to have it.

00:20:15.256 --> 00:20:20.845
And I stepped on his feet all those times...

00:20:21.096 --> 00:20:23.056
--Fam...
--What's wrong, Fam?

00:20:23.306 --> 00:20:24.766
Don't q-y!

00:20:25.809 --> 00:20:27.852
There's so much I wish I could've talked about...

00:20:28.103 --> 00:20:30.688
So much I wish I could've asked about my mom...

00:20:30.939 --> 00:20:35.110
So many potato pancakes
I wish we could've shared...

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:40.698
<i>The borders made of wind,
the disappearing sense of distance</i>

00:20:40.949 --> 00:20:46.996
<i>The sky's light shines equally on us all</i>

00:20:47.247 --> 00:20:53.461
<i>Who is it that teaches us kindness?</i>

00:20:53.628 --> 00:20:57.006
You cared that deeply for my sister...?

00:20:57.006 --> 00:20:59.676
<i>Where do we learn battle?</i>

00:20:59.926 --> 00:21:05.974
<i>If I were to let things lie after I hurt you</i>

00:21:06.224 --> 00:21:12.397
<i>And close the curtain on this without a word</i>

00:21:12.647 --> 00:21:22.240
<i>We'd never be able to understand each other</i>

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:22.699
<i>F am?</i>

00:21:22.949 --> 00:21:25.910
How am I supposed to brag if
I win the race without you in it?!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:30.457
<i>But I want to believe in dreams</i>

00:21:30.457 --> 00:21:30.999
Quit it!

00:21:30.999 --> 00:21:38.381
<i>In a day when we'll join hands</i>

00:21:38.381 --> 00:21:38.798
Wind...?

00:21:38.798 --> 00:21:43.553
<i>The wind crosses over the line</i>

00:21:43.553 --> 00:21:44.220
Let's fly in the Grand Race together!

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:56.983
<i>In the moment our cheeks touch, it's born</i>

00:21:56.983 --> 00:21:57.066
<i>"Get aw av'
“F am'!</i>

00:21:58.359 --> 00:22:01.070
Do you suppose I'll ever fly again?

00:22:02.489 --> 00:22:03.948
Immelmann...

00:22:04.199 --> 00:22:05.867
Of course you will!

00:22:06.117 --> 00:22:07.118
Lavie...

00:22:07.368 --> 00:22:10.914
The three of us will fly together
when the time comes! Right, Dio?

00:22:11.164 --> 00:22:13.666
Yeah... Sounds good!

00:22:13.917 --> 00:22:16.503
Fam! Giselle!

00:22:16.753 --> 00:22:19.672
--Good luck!
--Your Highness“!

00:22:21.341 --> 00:22:23.009
Just you watch, Millia!

00:22:23.259 --> 00:22:25.303
We're gonna win for sure!

00:22:25.553 --> 00:22:28.014
What's that? "Win"?

00:22:29.766 --> 00:22:32.560
--Dyan!
--Mind your own business!

00:22:36.022 --> 00:22:38.441
Let's go, Luciola!

00:22:47.700 --> 00:22:53.373
The Second Grand Race will now begin!

00:23:02.131 --> 00:23:04.425
People of the world!

00:23:04.676 --> 00:23:10.223
Let us celebrate the fact that this
joyous occasion has come once again!

00:23:13.518 --> 00:23:17.981
<i>Just now, I felt</i>

00:23:18.231 --> 00:23:25.822
<i>Like I could reach for the dream once more</i>

00:23:26.072 --> 00:23:30.910
<i>The wind crosses over the line</i>

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:44.340
<i>In the moment we climb over
the walls that limit us, it's born</i>
